<title>SPAIN: Iberia confirms agreement reached with BA.</title>
<headline>Iberia confirms agreement reached with BA.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish flag carrier Iberia confirmed on Friday it had reached a preliminary agreement on a co-operation deal with British Airways Plc.</p>
<p>&quot;We have reached an agreement,&quot; a spokeswoman for Iberia told Reuters.</p>
<p>She said the group expected to release a statement late in the afternoon, and may hold a news conference on the agreement on Monday.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
